"role comparisons in component_pool.py/clone_role_resolver.py are "
"case‑sensitive and byte‑wise; a homoglyph from another alphabet will "
"never match anything. Fix in Eeschema (Symbol Properties -> erase and "
"retype the value with the English layout), then Update PCB from "
"Schematic."
